        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.FirstName},&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Your Salesforce account has been successfully created, and you’ve been assigned a profile to support your work at Mainspring energy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Access Details:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;You will receive an email shortly with the subject line: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&quot;Welcome to Salesforce: Verify your account.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; This email will guide you through the process of verifying your account and setting up your password.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;We recommend that you sign-in to Salesforce using SSO after setting up a password. Please refer to the guide about signing into Salesforce using SSO:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jPIvDHZJAsjlMV03Oz9eRDzZ4GhuJoCFj6wJQs9QkSw/edit&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;SSO for Salesforce&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Next Steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Check Your Email:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; Look for an email with the subject line &quot;Welcome to Salesforce: Verify your account&quot; to get started with your Salesforce access.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarize Yourself with Salesforce:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt; Please refer to the guide for more details: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1DqPYmtmnHVcGXLXUIVCeWeFi97kPaB9pH4BVU6lCW5Y/edit#slide=id.p&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(17, 85, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Salesforce User Guide&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Need Help?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;For Salesforce process questions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;, please reach out to Matt at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:matt.white@mainspringenergy.com&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;matt.white@mainspringenergy.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
